"土属性攻击","values":[171,188],"baseValues":[171.02339999999998,187.7904],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[3,3],"unit":"%"},{"name":"恢复能力","values":[252,252],"baseValues":[252,252],"grows":true}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"恢复能力","min":8.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":6.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","min":4.0,"max":14.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":8.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"恢复能力","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"新增“休息吧，伊芙”与“过来吧，伊芙”能力。仅在生命值低于50%时，才可使用“休息吧，伊芙”。\n- 休息吧，伊芙：使用时从伊芙身上下来，并进入无敌状态，持续3秒。未骑乘伊芙期间，受到的伤害减免25%。“给你开处方”命中一定次数后，可使用“过来吧，伊芙”。\n- 过来吧，伊芙：使用时骑上伊芙。自身的移动速度与远程伤害提升15%，并加成30%额外生命，持续8秒。"}],"skill":{"name":"为了笑面神！","description":"地精们在目标周围出现，造成远程伤害，并使其陷入重伤状态。","levels":[3,6],"damage":[250.0,250.0],"cooldown":[9.4,7.6],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":null,"Height":[130],"Weight":[28]},"tribes":["地精"],"story":"诺艾尔是一位游历世界、治病救人的地精医生。\n\n她小时候名叫“莫拉”，出生于一个地精村庄。由于地精族与蚁族爆发战争，她早早便失去了父母，这也给她的心灵深处留下了难以磨灭的创伤。沦为孤儿的莫拉，终日蜷缩在角落独自哭泣。直到某天，她偶然遇见了一位路过的地精发明家博士，博士邀请她去自己的家中。无家可归的莫拉，从此便开始跟着博士一起生活。\n\n在跟博士一起生活的日子里，莫拉一直在寻找治愈心灵创伤的方法。某一天，她透过旅馆的窗棂望见飘落的雪花。那一刻，她感到自己的心灵得到了治愈，同时也首次对外面的世界产生了强烈的好奇心。此后，她每天都会凝视窗外，将所有她第一次见到的新奇事物统统记录在日记本里，憧憬着那片广阔而神秘的天地。在读完《地精小冒险》这本童话书后，她立志要像书中的主角 “诺艾尔” 一样，成为一名游历世界的帅气冒险家。\n\n然而，在一个暴风雪肆虐的冬日，莫拉试图像书中的主人公诺艾尔那样推窗而出，却不慎被暴雪卷走，因后遗症不幸失去了记忆。她忘却了所有过往，唯一还记得的只有“诺艾尔”这个名字。于是她误以为这就是自己的名字，并以这个名字开始了新的生活。\n\n时光荏苒，地精与蚁族的战争非但没有平息，反而愈演愈烈。目睹这一切的诺艾尔，决心尽自己所能拯救深陷战火的大家。她决定学习医术，日复一日精进技艺，最终诺艾尔成为了一名救治伤员的医生。尽管她总是忙得不可开交，但为了创造一个没有战争的和平世界，她始终全力以赴。\n\n后来，她利用地精族发明家博士的发明，终于平息了两族之间的战争，迎来了和平。与此同时，她也找回了自己过去的记忆。为了治疗人们的心灵创伤，给这个世界带来和平，她决定像博士那样前往外边的世界。整装待发的诺艾尔带着她的好朋友炸弹虫“伊芙”，纵身跃入以前红精灵制造的巨型光门。穿过光门后，她的身体骤然变大，恰好遇到了骑士一行人，随后便正式加入了浮空城。\n\n诺艾尔对外边的世界充满了好奇，对她来说浮游城里的一切都让人觉得新奇不已：长着牙齿和爪子的白色野兽、人来人往的汉堡店…尤其是每当她心心念念的“笑面神”出现在身边时，诺艾尔的心跳总会不由自主地加快。每当看到笑面神时，她都会满心欢喜地念诵祈祷文，可笑面神却始终对她的举动感到困惑不解。","storyKey":"profile_gnome_doctor_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=677","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=677","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"gnome_doctor","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["如果受伤了，别忍着，请一定要告诉我。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["这一定是笑面神的恩惠吧。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["我需要…疗愈心灵的创伤…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Die"]},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["医学研究容不得懈怠。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_GetExp"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["我找到了一种有效的治疗方法。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_LevelUp"]},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["医疗器械要随时保持干净。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_EquipWeapon"]},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["伊芙，我看起来怎么样？适合我吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_EquipCostume"]},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["笑面神，愿…您为世间带来和平。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Evolve"]},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["耶！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Attack1"]},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["哈！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Attack2"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["请不要紧张。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill1","label":"技能1","texts":{"zhCN":["会有一点刺痛。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Skill1"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["看来我们需要用强效处方了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Skill2"]},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["呃呜！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Damaged1"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["啊哈…！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_Damaged2"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["你真是位内心澄澈、温柔平和的人。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_PlayerChooseBright"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseDark","label":"人物邪恶值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["你的心里隐藏着创伤，对吗…？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_PlayerChooseDark"]},{"type":"WeakEnemyBattleStart","label":"与弱小敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["看来并不需要我的帮助。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_WeakEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"NormalEnemyBattleStart","label":"与普通敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["只不过是擦伤而已。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_NormalEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"StrongEnemyBattleStart","label":"与强大敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["看起来非常强，小心点。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_StrongEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"BossBattleStart","label":"与首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["看起来有点危险，我会在后方支援你的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_BossBattleStart"]},{"type":"JoinParty","label":"首次加入队伍","texts":{"zhCN":["伤患在哪里？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_JoinParty"]},{"type":"CoopAttack","label":"战斗-攻击","texts":{"zhCN":["治疗就交给我。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopHeal","label":"战斗-请求治疗","texts":{"zhCN":["治疗时请掩护我。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopHeal"]},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["这里很危险。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopRun"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["辛苦了。没受伤吧？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["我只是做了身为医生该做的事。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["你就是那位需要我照顾的人吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["要赶快行动。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["请务必遵守医嘱。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["你见过白色花瓣吗？每次看到都会让人心里暖暖的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_gnome_doctor_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["药本来就是苦的。要咬紧牙关吞下去。","良药苦口，咬紧牙关，吞下去吧。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_gnome_doctor_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["我经常叫大多数病人几日后再来复诊，但总觉得他们不常来复诊。","我常常嘱咐病人们几日后再来复诊，可他们却很少来赴约。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_gnome_doctor_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["从今天起，你余生的每一天，都要服用一粒这种药。为什么只有三粒？因为…这就是完整的剂量了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_gnome_doctor_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["邮件？哦，大概是医疗账单吧？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_1_NoticeMail","cv_gnome_doctor_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["冬季庆典快到了。我得提前准备好，以防出现伤患。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_NoticeEvent"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["我是诺艾尔医生。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_SummonSpeech1"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech2","label":"召唤-台词2","texts":{"zhCN":["我来到此地，是为了治愈人们心中的创伤。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_SummonSpeech2"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech3","label":"召唤-台词3","texts":{"zhCN":["在这充斥着纷争与战火的世界里，我愿为大家带来和平。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_SummonSpeech3"]}]},{"id":"gnome_doctor_myth","label":"开花","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["请详细说明你的状况和症状。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["以笑面神的名义祈祷——洛门。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["对不起…博士…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_Die"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["现在我可以拯救更多的人了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_LevelUp"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["卷起你的袖子。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["如果疼的话，请举起你的左手。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_Skill2"]},{"type":"LeaderSkill","label":"队长技能","texts":{"zhCN":["愿和平，遍布世界的每一个角落。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_LeaderSkill"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["伊芙，没事吧…？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_Damaged2"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["作为医者，理应守护患者的生命与尊严。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_PlayerChooseBright"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseDark","label":"人物邪恶值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["尊重患者的自主权也很重要。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_PlayerChooseDark"]},{"type":"StrongEnemyBattleStart","label":"与强大敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["伊芙，紧靠在我身边。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_StrongEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"CoopAttack","label":"战斗-攻击","texts":{"zhCN":["前方就拜托你了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["能安然无恙真是太好了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["做得好，伊芙。待会我会给你带点好吃的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["我会为你仔细诊疗一遍。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["再这样下去，就要错过黄金救治时间了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_gnome_doctor_myth_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["你见过白色花瓣吗？每次看到都会让人心里暖暖的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_myth_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_gnome_doctor_myth_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["谁都可能遭遇心灵的伤痛，而愿意接受治愈，才是最勇敢的开始。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_myth_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_gnome_doctor_myth_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["我常常嘱咐病人们几日后再来复诊，可他们却很少来赴约。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_myth_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_gnome_doctor_myth_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["你觉得人什么时候会死？喝下剧毒蘑菇汤的时候？没错。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_myth_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_gnome_doctor_myth_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["邮件？哦，大概是医疗账单吧？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_gnome_doctor_myth_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
